/Title (A major and commonly overlooked pitfall in banking automation is the failure to capture temporal variation. Banking processes are inherently time-dependent, interest accrues, penalties apply, compliance windows open and close, and End-of-Day processing changes system states overnight. Static test data is blind to all of this.)
